    <node id="&quot;ROBERT SCHEERER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Robert Scheerer is an American actor known for his versatility on stage and screen, currently in India for months, immersing himself in local culture and honing his craft."&lt;SEP&gt;"Robert Scheerer is an actor who has received a prestigious award and is considered one of the most talented and respected actors of his generation."</data>
